            {
                "entry_id": "4119a9c4-1c40-32a8-af0c-b90cc4265bee",
                "word": "geroezemoes",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "20db25c6-50ac-3e50-9e5f-31e8710d64fa",
                        "entry_id": "4119a9c4-1c40-32a8-af0c-b90cc4265bee",
                        "glosses": [
                            "een achtergrondgeluid bestaande uit veel door elkaar sprekende stemmen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cda4ab98-2b05-449a-8f7b-852dc31415a9",
                                "sense_id": "20db25c6-50ac-3e50-9e5f-31e8710d64fa",
                                "text": "Door de hitte en het constante geroezemoes viel hij bijna in slaap."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3dab3c75-a31c-4c19-9f33-e378aaab0785",
                                "sense_id": "20db25c6-50ac-3e50-9e5f-31e8710d64fa",
                                "text": "Van heimwee had ik bepaald geen last als we vroeger met ons gezin op vakantie gingen. Dolenthousiast was ik: een halfjaar van tevoren keek ik er al naar uit. Dat ik nu al reizend kan werken, vind ik geweldig. Voor het eerst lopen door de straten van New York of waar dan ook ter wereld: er maakt zich een enorme opwinding van mij meester als ik op een nieuwe plek kom. Dat ik geen vaste werkplek heb, is voor mij geen punt. Ik weet genoeg werkplekken te vinden die te huur zijn. Voor geroezemoes of getinkel van bestek kan ik me goed afsluiten."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5eb3515f-995d-40a2-9d54-5799b3428b72",
                                "sense_id": "20db25c6-50ac-3e50-9e5f-31e8710d64fa",
                                "text": "Het café zag er in al zijn exotische alledaagsheid uit als een filmcoulisse, vlak boven zijn hoofd hing een opgezet hert, schilderijen met dieren in een bergomgeving aan de gelambriseerde muren, het publiek zag eruit als figuranten in een film, sterke vrouwenarmen die overvolle dienbladen droegen met halveliterglazen bier alsof ze alleen maar melk voor de koffie rondbrachten, het geroezemoes van de vreemde taal, iemand aan een naburig tafeltje vertelde heel luid een verhaal waar hij natuurlijk geen woord van begreep maar toch om lachte toen de toehoorders in lachen uitbarstten, zich op de knie sloegen en hun schuimende bierglazen ophieven."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7ec9ff79-ecc0-4108-8adc-38078068b283",
                        "source_entry_id": "4119a9c4-1c40-32a8-af0c-b90cc4265bee",
                        "source_sense_id": "20db25c6-50ac-3e50-9e5f-31e8710d64fa",
                        "source_sense_description": "een achtergrondgeluid bestaande uit veel door elkaar sprekende stemmen",
                        "target_lang_word": "Stimmengewirr",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Stimmengewirr",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "214b0313-7b55-3a9d-8eb4-74f01360293c",
                                        "entry_id": "bf9a956e-d77a-3c7c-a46d-67cf29e0332f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Durcheinander gleichzeitig zu hörender Stimmen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "653071e4-a758-4c2f-bea8-e9c142ad6974",
                                                "sense_id": "214b0313-7b55-3a9d-8eb4-74f01360293c",
                                                "text": "„Nachts ertönte aus der Männergruppe leises Stimmengewirr.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1990dbc1-bcad-4e01-ae52-6ce352b96f79",
                                                "sense_id": "214b0313-7b55-3a9d-8eb4-74f01360293c",
                                                "text": "„Da ertönt aus dem Stimmengewirr der Vorschlag, man solle am nächsten Tag zum Siegburger Zeughaus aufbrechen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8589882b-26fe-4e1f-899c-bf624f459947",
                                                "sense_id": "214b0313-7b55-3a9d-8eb4-74f01360293c",
                                                "text": "„Das Stimmengwirr auf dem Marktplatz von Ouida ist betäubend laut.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "326bca5c-3a09-40b7-8d8c-7835078fa154",
                                                "sense_id": "214b0313-7b55-3a9d-8eb4-74f01360293c",
                                                "text": "„Jeden Abend ging sie tanzen, mit einem anderen Mädchen oder allein, und sie traf ihn im Stimmengewirr und den billigen Düften des Tanzpavillons.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ce03984-2572-401b-b5eb-ae12e3801e6e",
                                                "sense_id": "214b0313-7b55-3a9d-8eb4-74f01360293c",
                                                "text": "„Plötzlich hielt das Taxi unvermittelt an, und Ferris hörte arabisches Stimmengewirr.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "91465a40-62af-4750-94ad-63f563e0b906",
                        "source_entry_id": "4119a9c4-1c40-32a8-af0c-b90cc4265bee",
                        "source_sense_id": "20db25c6-50ac-3e50-9e5f-31e8710d64fa",
                        "source_sense_description": "een achtergrondgeluid bestaande uit veel door elkaar sprekende stemmen",
                        "target_lang_word": "buzz",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "buzz",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "521a27ef-748a-3b59-94fa-fa90a2c580da",
                                        "entry_id": "f1712c0c-40da-3227-b7d2-601e74d00195",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A continuous humming noise, as of bees; a confused murmur, as of general conversation in low tones."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a81cfa06-ab1b-4d3b-bbb0-c61e5b3daaac",
                                                "sense_id": "521a27ef-748a-3b59-94fa-fa90a2c580da",
                                                "text": "In the steady buzz of flies the homeward-bound agent was lying flushed and insensible[.]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df725077-25bf-4c4f-8629-01622f54c31d",
                                                "sense_id": "521a27ef-748a-3b59-94fa-fa90a2c580da",
                                                "text": "This probably explains the interest in UVB-76, or “The Buzzer,” a mysterious shortwave radio station that has been operating since 1982 and whose output consists of a monotonous buzz repeated 24 hours a day, occasionally interrupted by a Russian voice."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d0e34326-2c29-39fe-b5a2-4a6bb3376a2d",
                                        "entry_id": "f1712c0c-40da-3227-b7d2-601e74d00195",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A whisper."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "000eefb9-12ce-3678-91d9-ccc9025eabd3",
                                        "entry_id": "f1712c0c-40da-3227-b7d2-601e74d00195",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The audible friction of voiced consonants."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7bdf9ca8-87fc-310f-89c8-a94d53bda9a4",
                                        "entry_id": "f1712c0c-40da-3227-b7d2-601e74d00195",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A rush or feeling of energy or excitement; a feeling of slight intoxication."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "informal",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f8b026b-ed3d-449f-ac02-e93e1da49004",
                                                "sense_id": "7bdf9ca8-87fc-310f-89c8-a94d53bda9a4",
                                                "text": "Still feeling the buzz from the coffee, he pushed through the last of the homework."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d37d11c8-f84e-3b3a-81a9-b1664c3e283c",
                                        "entry_id": "f1712c0c-40da-3227-b7d2-601e74d00195",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A telephone call or e-mail."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "informal",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b1941db-0b48-418e-b82b-71df7283a446",
                                                "sense_id": "d37d11c8-f84e-3b3a-81a9-b1664c3e283c",
                                                "text": "Now, don't waste time, give us a buzz -- quick! 825-4703 or 265-7881."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "557a69ce-e6b5-32ca-b995-d4a5091c7759",
                                        "entry_id": "f1712c0c-40da-3227-b7d2-601e74d00195",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Major topic of conversation; widespread rumor; information spread behind the scenes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "informal",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2984747e-ebc2-4229-86d3-901012fa317e",
                                                "sense_id": "557a69ce-e6b5-32ca-b995-d4a5091c7759",
                                                "text": "Mr. Hall? The buzz on Christian is that his parents have joint custody, so he'll be spending one semester in Chicago and one semester here."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6a369fd-9827-434d-ac92-8b2753df333d",
                                                "sense_id": "557a69ce-e6b5-32ca-b995-d4a5091c7759",
                                                "text": "I wasn't performing with Pimp and Smoove that much no more, but I had a solo deal with Ruthless Rap and a brand new mixtape that was creating a big buzz."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c13bf5b-3d5d-405a-8bd5-4cb12a4e5e6f",
                                                "sense_id": "557a69ce-e6b5-32ca-b995-d4a5091c7759",
                                                "text": "In Detroit, the buzz is that he's too nice a guy, unwilling to impose draconian job cuts at the risk of angering the UAW."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1618a5ee-3025-40b5-9d2a-ed21f1752b94",
                                                "sense_id": "557a69ce-e6b5-32ca-b995-d4a5091c7759",
                                                "text": "Allen Gregory DeLongpre: Who's he?\nPatrick: He's only the most popular kid in school.\nAllen Gregory: Ah, the two heavyweights finally meet. Sure you're tired of all the buzz. Allen Gregory DeLongpre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5041af99-3880-36e3-825c-33db93c5af1a",
                                        "entry_id": "f1712c0c-40da-3227-b7d2-601e74d00195",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of fizz-buzz (“counting game”)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "buzz",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b2c7f016-0618-363b-b536-ab81cdd9e74c",
                                        "entry_id": "63bebb35-da91-3abd-9d7f-d919d1d87cab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make a low, continuous, humming or sibilant sound, like that made by bees with their wings."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28914d69-eaba-4220-b5ff-5185ebf33ea0",
                                                "sense_id": "b2c7f016-0618-363b-b536-ab81cdd9e74c",
                                                "text": "Ah! the singing, fatal arrow, / Like a wasp it buzzed, and stung him [a roebuck]!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46c61684-d70b-4bfa-868f-67ceafc1fbc7",
                                                "sense_id": "b2c7f016-0618-363b-b536-ab81cdd9e74c",
                                                "text": "So that now the universe has escaped from the pin which was pushed through it, like an impaled fly vainly buzzing: now that the multiple universe flies its own complicated course quite free, and hasn't got any hub, we can hope also to escape."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f66c1d10-b1e7-35a3-9938-9788d95ce1f7",
                                        "entry_id": "63bebb35-da91-3abd-9d7f-d919d1d87cab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make a low, continuous, humming or sibilant sound, like that made by bees with their wings.",
                                            "To utter a murmuring sound; to speak with a low, humming voice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6fb8f085-3dbf-4c0c-851f-9a693e633ad1",
                                                "sense_id": "f66c1d10-b1e7-35a3-9938-9788d95ce1f7",
                                                "text": "However these disturbers of our peace / Buzz in the people's ears."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bd62d5de-7508-36c8-a5d4-f4bab9b12a7b",
                                        "entry_id": "63bebb35-da91-3abd-9d7f-d919d1d87cab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make a low, continuous, humming or sibilant sound, like that made by bees with their wings.",
                                            "Of a group of people, to talk about some interesting topic excitedly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86d362a0-07c7-4440-bfd3-0adbe2c8626a",
                                                "sense_id": "bd62d5de-7508-36c8-a5d4-f4bab9b12a7b",
                                                "text": "But I tell you this has set all London buzzing. The old man is where he likes to be, with a pin-point limelight right on his hairy old head."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "26d72c9d-0a8c-3a6a-a379-85fc2e0d82ef",
                                        "entry_id": "63bebb35-da91-3abd-9d7f-d919d1d87cab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make a low, continuous, humming or sibilant sound, like that made by bees with their wings.",
                                            "To fly while making such a sound."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4768ec3-e65a-43c2-a436-b46113b42d87",
                                                "sense_id": "26d72c9d-0a8c-3a6a-a379-85fc2e0d82ef",
                                                "text": "The flies, lethargic with the autumn, were beginning to buzz into the room."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b43d4a8-f206-4144-9039-e8b1561aef4c",
                                                "sense_id": "26d72c9d-0a8c-3a6a-a379-85fc2e0d82ef",
                                                "text": "A fly was buzzing past me."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc153e11-a3d2-342a-b990-51fedde8858e",
                                        "entry_id": "63bebb35-da91-3abd-9d7f-d919d1d87cab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To show a high level of activity and haste, energization or excitement, to be busy as a bee in one’s actions but perhaps mentally charged."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54b06bf3-11a4-3064-8fda-d8fabe4b3a19",
                                        "entry_id": "63bebb35-da91-3abd-9d7f-d919d1d87cab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To whisper; to communicate, as tales, in an undertone; to spread, as a report, by whispers or secretly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d3dc0d1-7355-4ab6-9ee0-79f903df7d3c",
                                                "sense_id": "54b06bf3-11a4-3064-8fda-d8fabe4b3a19",
                                                "text": "I will buzz abroad such prophecies / That Edward shall be fearful of his life."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a83363c1-e95a-36c3-bf3c-ba77b9a46b5d",
                                        "entry_id": "63bebb35-da91-3abd-9d7f-d919d1d87cab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To talk to incessantly or confidentially in a low humming voice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2cf984f8-65e5-3fa2-a816-c1123faa49c9",
                                        "entry_id": "63bebb35-da91-3abd-9d7f-d919d1d87cab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To fly at high speed and at a very low altitude over a specified area, as to make a surprise pass."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "045f5e06-28c4-4f51-8ad7-b18ec1be8ba6",
                                                "sense_id": "2cf984f8-65e5-3fa2-a816-c1123faa49c9",
                                                "text": "[…] an asteroid a mere 15-20 metres across exploded with the force of a medium-sized atom bomb over Chelyabinsk, in Russia, and another, much larger one buzzed Earth a few hours later."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "59b300cb-5167-374c-aa96-25f2934bcc44",
                                        "entry_id": "63bebb35-da91-3abd-9d7f-d919d1d87cab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cut (the hair) in a close-cropped military style, or buzzcut."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0ad4b05-5c8d-4e22-98bb-54863701c1e1",
                                                "sense_id": "59b300cb-5167-374c-aa96-25f2934bcc44",
                                                "text": "Deacon said, “You used to beg me to let you buzz your hair when you were little.” “And then I grew up and realized how awful you looked when you buzzed yours.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1af12043-6da7-39a3-8b82-2e1ba6d830f6",
                                        "entry_id": "63bebb35-da91-3abd-9d7f-d919d1d87cab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To throw swiftly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd10284a-6bc9-4e6f-b562-31ce71e76a5a",
                                                "sense_id": "1af12043-6da7-39a3-8b82-2e1ba6d830f6",
                                                "text": "I have mentioned her deft hand with a stone — well, as soon as our backs were turned she buzzed a stone to clip Joe's ear."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "91ff924b-a34c-3e30-ae55-0c6b9d3ddfde",
                                        "entry_id": "63bebb35-da91-3abd-9d7f-d919d1d87cab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To drink to the bottom."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2202b55-6fd3-4314-be0b-ee2d8fa71199",
                                                "sense_id": "91ff924b-a34c-3e30-ae55-0c6b9d3ddfde",
                                                "text": "He buzzed the bottle with such a hearty good will as settled the fate of another, which Soapey rang for as a matter of course. There was but the rejected one, which however Spigot put into a different decanter and brought in […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c4787477-5e9c-3a41-aab6-2e5416ebf298",
                                        "entry_id": "63bebb35-da91-3abd-9d7f-d919d1d87cab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To communicate with (a person) by means of a buzzer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34af6786-efbe-4250-8d50-0d075f11d2c7",
                                                "sense_id": "c4787477-5e9c-3a41-aab6-2e5416ebf298",
                                                "text": "Then one day my secretary buzzed me and said Frank Sinatra was on the phone. When I picked up the phone it was the Chief who played dumb and would not admit that he said he was Frank Sinatra."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "873aa2ab-493a-417b-8c4f-b119d9111c5b",
                        "source_entry_id": "4119a9c4-1c40-32a8-af0c-b90cc4265bee",
                        "source_sense_id": "20db25c6-50ac-3e50-9e5f-31e8710d64fa",
                        "source_sense_description": "een achtergrondgeluid bestaande uit veel door elkaar sprekende stemmen",
                        "target_lang_word": "brouhaha",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "brouhaha",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a9e15878-7d76-35b0-9cf1-c6dfdcdf5013",
                                        "entry_id": "7a23af88-4d4a-30d2-b7bc-c4d14050f768",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bruit confus produit par une foule, et qui est souvent un signe d’approbation ou de désapprobation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22c9ed6f-4350-4071-9406-fdb20d36c736",
                                                "sense_id": "a9e15878-7d76-35b0-9cf1-c6dfdcdf5013",
                                                "text": "Un brouhaha, une tempête d’exclamations accueillit ces paroles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4d8a0f7-73b0-4002-8b8f-d1f3c211a5bd",
                                                "sense_id": "a9e15878-7d76-35b0-9cf1-c6dfdcdf5013",
                                                "text": "Le capitaine, lui, heureux de ce brouhaha, satisfait du plaisir que prenaient ces pauvres gens, relégués pour ainsi dire au-delà du monde habitable, se promenait joyeusement au milieu de ses invités."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8caadcd-4a5a-47a7-9bda-51fc15e2978d",
                                                "sense_id": "a9e15878-7d76-35b0-9cf1-c6dfdcdf5013",
                                                "text": "J'ai encore dans l'oreille le formidable brouhaha qui accueillit les ministres pénétrant dans la salle des séances. Les socialistes debout hurlent : « Vive la Commune » au passage de Gallifet. La droite et une partie du centre invectivent, en un langage de porcherie, « le ministère Dreyfus. »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "405e9b32-7420-4ec1-9d75-45460df09910",
                                                "sense_id": "a9e15878-7d76-35b0-9cf1-c6dfdcdf5013",
                                                "text": "Nous trouvons des places au milieu d'une mer de chapeaux dans le brouhaha étouffé des conversations. La mariée arrive avec le retard de circonstance, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a56c5e68-43cf-4447-b654-3328587cb7a4",
                                                "sense_id": "a9e15878-7d76-35b0-9cf1-c6dfdcdf5013",
                                                "text": "Comment parvenons-nous à suivre une conversation dans le brouhaha d’une foule, d’un restaurant bondé ou lors d’un concert ? Ces situations où le bruit brouille l’écoute amènent à s’interroger sur la structure du son émis par l’interlocuteur, sur celle du fond sonore, et sur la façon dont le système auditif perçoit et analyse l’ensemble, séparant le bon grain communicationnel de l’ivraie cacophonique."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "115c7f1e-6d7c-3877-ac2b-5ec204b6f74b",
                                        "entry_id": "7a23af88-4d4a-30d2-b7bc-c4d14050f768",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bruit confus, tumulte."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b438432-1c33-4b83-9f51-f373ac1995ef",
                                                "sense_id": "115c7f1e-6d7c-3877-ac2b-5ec204b6f74b",
                                                "text": "Il y avait foule. Derrière la haie de soldats qui s'effrangeaient devant le carré réservé à l'échafaud commença à s'élever un brouhaha."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dbdc544d-a30a-46fd-b288-5f3be702a6ae",
                                                "sense_id": "115c7f1e-6d7c-3877-ac2b-5ec204b6f74b",
                                                "text": "Dans la salle à manger, marron et or, pleine de lumières, je me suis assis à la table d’hôte. C’est un scintillement général, un brouhaha, le grand empressement vide du début des repas."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b19e4613-9a3f-3438-86a7-f4a699233fc3",
                                        "entry_id": "7a23af88-4d4a-30d2-b7bc-c4d14050f768",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Agitation, sans idée de bruit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a59ca3e4-d36e-4c57-b97f-99d2d375d940",
                                                "sense_id": "b19e4613-9a3f-3438-86a7-f4a699233fc3",
                                                "text": "Le brouhaha des idées parisiennes s'efface."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34256f30-66b0-47a5-82bb-af27377ac800",
                                                "sense_id": "b19e4613-9a3f-3438-86a7-f4a699233fc3",
                                                "text": "Dans le brouhaha qui a suivi, parmi les mouvements circulaires d'une foule vibrionique qui tourne autour des Habits Verts, Étienne s'est senti fier de la présenter à quelques relations qui la jugent, qui la jaugent, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c79f8a75-dc45-45b5-9111-ad1674469dbd",
                                                "sense_id": "b19e4613-9a3f-3438-86a7-f4a699233fc3",
                                                "text": "Des gens issus de la majorité blanche ont tôt fait de se lancer dans le débat. Ils ont défendu la liberté d’expression dans un contexte académique, ils ont statué sur ce que représente une micro-agression, même s’ils n’en ont jamais vécue. Les voix des personnes principalement concernées par ce débat ont été enterrées par tout ce brouhaha."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
